# CMake artifacts — the *.cmake catch-all silently eats the ffmpeg-leak
# guard script in cmake/. Re-include CMakeLists.txt + cmake/*.cmake so
# the guard script can be committed (per AY2D .gitignore gotcha).
*.cmake
!CMakeLists.txt
!**/CMakeLists.txt
!cmake/*.cmake
!**/cmake/*.cmake

